{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635500/extras/39fcf5cbe1ee49da003b8bf976d863e1.poster.avif?t=1752845997\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635500/extras/39fcf5cbe1ee49da003b8bf976d863e1.webm?t=1752845997\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>City Defense Z</strong> is a strategic survival game where you build cities with cards by day and defend against zombies by night. Choose your cards, merge buildings, strengthen your defenses and adapt your tactics to face ever-changing threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635500/extras/376e07cf5f5ced9e703fcf3518e4e5b6.poster.avif?t=1752845997\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635500/extras/376e07cf5f5ced9e703fcf3518e4e5b6.webp?t=1752845997\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build by Day, Survive by Night</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the daylight hours to expand your city, manage your resources carefully and fortify your defenses. When night falls, the rules change. Relentless waves of zombies advance with the sole purpose of destroying all you've built. Each night brings larger, more dangerous hordes, making preparation your only hope. In the darkness, nothing can be trusted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635500/extras/b15b5fae012799b7c249a5617662fc27.poster.avif?t=1752845997\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635500/extras/b15b5fae012799b7c249a5617662fc27.webp?t=1752845997\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Every Day Brings a New Trial</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In City Defense Z, the way you play defines the outcome. Your use of cards and the placement of buildings reshape the entire battlefield. Spend your daytime gathering resources, expanding your city, and optimizing your defense strategy. Position your units with care and plant mines where they\u2019ll have the most impact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635500/extras/e5c35b1e5824d731356e793bcee7e3e7.poster.avif?t=1752845997\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635500/extras/e5c35b1e5824d731356e793bcee7e3e7.webp?t=1752845997\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Defend Your City with Strategy and Strength</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When night falls, everything you\u2019ve set up during the day is put to the test. Zombie waves come fast and fierce. Call in air support at the right moment and guide specific units by adjusting their attack focus in real time. Stay alert and think quickly to outsmart every incoming threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635500/extras/e2685209b95a45d0c35963eb754f0e01.poster.avif?t=1752845997\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635500/extras/e2685209b95a45d0c35963eb754f0e01.webm?t=1752845997\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Building Types</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Barracks</strong>: Produce defensive units.<br><strong>House</strong>: Increases population capacity and supports more citizens.<br><strong>Factory</strong>: Generates resources to accelerate your development.<br><strong>Farm</strong>: Produces food to feed your population.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635500/extras/2829f44f40d86bc47aa7fb9a7d08d97b.poster.avif?t=1752845997\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635500/extras/2829f44f40d86bc47aa7fb9a7d08d97b.webm?t=1752845997\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Main Base Defense</strong><br>Protect the heart of your city to stay in the game<br><strong>Resource Management</strong><br>Make the most of your limited resources to expand and upgrade your city.<br><strong>Building Merge Mechanic</strong><br>Merge over 20 types of buildings to create powerful and unique structures.<br><strong>Defense Strategy</strong><br>Position your units wisely, call in reinforcements, and fend off waves of the undead.<br><strong>Dynamic Day-Night Cycle</strong><br>Plan during the day, fight through the night. Each day brings new challenges.<br><strong>Increasing Difficulty</strong><br>As your city grows, the zombie hordes will become larger and more dangerous.\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635500/extras/5.gif?t=1752845997\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2635500?t=1752845997","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2635500?t=1752845997","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstati