ai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635500/extras/e2685209b95a45d0c35963eb754f0e01.poster.avif?t=1752845997\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635500/extras/e2685209b95a45d0c35963eb754f0e01.webm?t=1752845997\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Building Types</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Barracks</strong>: Produce defensive units.<br><strong>House</strong>: Increases population capacity and supports more citizens.<br><strong>Factory</strong>: Generates resources to accelerate your development.<br><strong>Farm</strong>: Produces food to feed your population.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635500/extras/2829f44f40d86bc47aa7fb9a7d08d97b.poster.avif?t=1752845997\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635500/extras/2829f44f40d86bc47aa7fb9a7d08d97b.webm?t=1752845997\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Main Base Defense</strong><br>Protect the heart of your city to stay in the game<br><strong>Resource Management</strong><br>Make the most of your limited resources to expand and upgrade your city.<br><strong>Building Merge Mechanic</strong><br>Merge over 20 types of buildings to create powerful and unique structures.<br><strong>Defense Strategy</strong><br>Position your units wisely, call in reinforcements, and fend off waves of the undead.<br><strong>Dynamic Day-Night Cycle</strong><br>Plan during the day, fight through the night. Each day brings new challenges.<br><strong>Increasing Difficulty</strong><br>As your city grows, the zombie hordes will become larger and more dangerous.\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:/